WEBVTT

00:00:11.995 --> 00:00:13.155
SHERMAN: Barbara.

00:00:13.235 --> 00:00:15.035
Prep for his anterior crown,
would you, please?

00:00:15.435 --> 00:00:18.515
-And I'll need more cotton rolls.
-All right.

00:00:21.555 --> 00:00:22.635
Hello, little fella.

00:00:24.075 --> 00:00:25.075
Beauty, isn't he?

00:00:25.155 --> 00:00:28.715
I found that guy struggling for life
and I saved him.

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:31.315
-Has that Novocain kicked in yet?
-(PATIENT GABBLES)

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.315
Bubbles!

00:00:39.875 --> 00:00:42.835
-My bubbles.
-He likes bubbles.

00:00:43.795 --> 00:00:45.475
(FRIGHTENED CRIES)

00:00:49.155 --> 00:00:50.835
(WHIMPERS)

00:00:54.195 --> 00:00:55.315
-Bonjour.
-Aagghh!

00:00:56.195 --> 00:00:59.915
Slow down, little fella.
There's nothing to worry about.

00:00:59.995 --> 00:01:02.195
-He's scared to death.
-I want to go home.

00:01:03.075 --> 00:01:04.475
Do you know where my dad is?

00:01:04.555 --> 00:01:07.195
Your dad's probably
back at the pet store.

00:01:07.275 --> 00:01:08.635
Pet store?

00:01:08.715 --> 00:01:11.835
-Like I'm from Bob's Fish Mart.
-Pet Palace.

00:01:11.915 --> 00:01:13.315
-Fish-O-Rama.
-Mail order.

00:01:13.395 --> 00:01:14.675
eBay.

00:01:14.755 --> 00:01:17.195
-Which one is it?
-I'm from the ocean.

00:01:17.275 --> 00:01:20.595
Ah, the ocean. The ocean! Aagghh!

00:01:21.035 --> 00:01:23.955
He hasn't been decontaminated yet.
Jacques!

00:01:24.035 --> 00:01:25.395
-Clean him!
-Oui.

00:01:26.915 --> 00:01:28.475
-Ocean.
-La mer.

00:01:31.355 --> 00:01:32.835
Voilà. He is clean.

00:01:35.835 --> 00:01:38.955
Wow. The big blue. What's it like?

00:01:39.515 --> 00:01:41.835
Uh... Big and blue?

00:01:41.915 --> 00:01:42.955
I knew it.

00:01:43.035 --> 00:01:46.435
If there's anything you need,
ask your Auntie Deb. That's me.

00:01:46.515 --> 00:01:51.115
If I'm not around you can always
talk to my sister, Flo. Hi. How are you?

00:01:51.195 --> 00:01:54.275
Don't listen to anything my sister says.
She's nuts.

00:01:54.355 --> 00:01:55.435
(MUFFLED CALL)

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:58.515
-Can't hear you, Peach.
-I said we got a live one.

00:01:58.595 --> 00:01:59.955
-Yes!
-Boy, oh, boy.

00:02:00.035 --> 00:02:02.155
-What have we got?
-Root canal.

00:02:02.235 --> 00:02:03.555
It's not going to be pretty.

00:02:04.235 --> 00:02:05.315
Aagghh!

00:02:05.395 --> 00:02:06.755
-Clamp installed?
-Yup.

00:02:06.835 --> 00:02:10.275
-What did he use to open?
-Glidden drill. He favors that one.

00:02:11.115 --> 00:02:13.275
I can't see, Flo.

00:02:13.995 --> 00:02:15.435
(MUMBLES) Agh!

00:02:15.515 --> 00:02:18.155
-Schilder Technique.
-That's a Hedstrom file.

00:02:18.235 --> 00:02:20.675
That's not a Hedstrom file.
That's a K-Flex.

00:02:20.755 --> 00:02:23.755
It's got a teardrop cross section.
A Hedstrom.

00:02:23.835 --> 00:02:26.515
-K-Flex!
-Hedstrom!

00:02:26.595 --> 00:02:28.715
There I go. Little help. Over here.

00:02:28.795 --> 00:02:30.635
I'll go deflate him.

00:02:30.835 --> 00:02:31.835
Pffft!

00:02:32.635 --> 00:02:34.835
All right. Go ahead and rinse.

00:02:35.795 --> 00:02:38.235
The human mouth
is a disgusting place.

00:02:41.075 --> 00:02:42.715
-Nigel.
-What did I miss?

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:45.755
-Root canal. A doozy.
-What did he use to open?

00:02:45.835 --> 00:02:47.555
-Glidden drill.
-He favors it.

00:02:47.635 --> 00:02:50.755
Hope he doesn't get surplus sealer
at the portal terminus.

00:02:50.835 --> 00:02:53.835
-Hello. Who's this?
-New guy.

00:02:53.915 --> 00:02:56.515
-The dentist took him off the reef.
-An outie.

00:02:56.595 --> 00:02:59.355
From my neck of the woods?
Sorry if I took a snap at you.

00:02:59.435 --> 00:03:01.635
Fish got to swim. Birds got to eat.

00:03:01.715 --> 00:03:06.155
No, no. Those aren't your fish.
They're my fish. Come on. Go. Shoo.

00:03:08.875 --> 00:03:12.115
The picture broke.
This here's Darla. She's my niece.

00:03:12.195 --> 00:03:13.235
Going to be eight this week.

00:03:13.315 --> 00:03:16.555
Hey, little fella.
Say hello to your new mummy.

00:03:16.635 --> 00:03:19.035
She's going to be here Friday
to pick you up.

00:03:19.115 --> 00:03:20.875
You're her present.

00:03:20.995 --> 00:03:22.955
Shh! It's our little secret.

00:03:23.035 --> 00:03:24.315
Well, Mr. Tucker,

00:03:24.435 --> 00:03:27.755
while that sets up, I'm going to
go see a man about a wallaby.

00:03:29.395 --> 00:03:30.515
Uh-oh. Darla!

00:03:30.595 --> 00:03:34.275
-What's wrong with her?
-She wouldn't stop shaking the bag.

00:03:35.555 --> 00:03:38.795
-Poor Chuckles.
-He was her present last year.

00:03:38.875 --> 00:03:41.595
Hitched a ride on the porcelain express.

00:03:43.275 --> 00:03:45.195
She's a fish killer.

00:03:46.115 --> 00:03:49.755
I can't go with that girl.
I have to get back to my dad.

00:03:50.875 --> 00:03:54.155
-Daddy! Help me!
-He's stuck.

00:03:59.355 --> 00:04:01.155
Nobody touch him.

00:04:07.075 --> 00:04:08.395
Can you help me?

00:04:08.475 --> 00:04:11.795
No. You got yourself in there,
you can get yourself out.

00:04:11.875 --> 00:04:14.635
-Gill...
-I just want to see him do it, okay?

00:04:14.715 --> 00:04:18.235
Calm down. Alternate wiggling
your fins and your tail.

00:04:18.315 --> 00:04:21.235
I can't. I have a bad fin.

00:04:21.315 --> 00:04:23.075
Never stopped me.

00:04:27.395 --> 00:04:29.675
Just think about what you need to do.

00:04:34.075 --> 00:04:35.235
Come on.

00:04:39.595 --> 00:04:40.635
Perfect.

00:04:40.715 --> 00:04:43.515
-You did it.
-Good squirming.

00:04:44.715 --> 00:04:47.835
Wow, from the ocean!
Just like you, Gill.

00:04:47.915 --> 00:04:49.075
Yeah.

00:04:49.915 --> 00:04:53.195
I've seen that look before.
What are you thinking about?

00:04:53.275 --> 00:04:58.195
I'm thinking tonight we give
the kid a proper reception.

00:04:58.675 --> 00:05:01.555
-So, kid, you got a name or what?
-Nemo.

00:05:01.635 --> 00:05:03.115
I'm Nemo.

00:05:03.595 --> 00:05:04.715
Nemo.

00:05:06.675 --> 00:05:07.995
Nemo.

00:05:12.715 --> 00:05:14.715
DORY: (IN SLEEP)
You going to eat that?

00:05:25.755 --> 00:05:27.675
Careful of that hammer.

00:05:36.675 --> 00:05:38.555
-Dory!
-Sea-Monkey has my money.

00:05:38.635 --> 00:05:40.875
Wake up. Get up.

00:05:40.955 --> 00:05:43.555
-Come on.
-Yes, I'm a natural blue.

00:05:43.635 --> 00:05:45.435
-Get up!
-Look out. Sharks eat fish!

00:05:52.475 --> 00:05:53.555
(DORY SCREAMS)

